  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "The term 'goat humpers' in the meme is a derogatory racial slur that references the harmful and offensive stereotype of comparing Black people to primates. This stereotype is rooted in historical racism and is used to dehumanize and demean Black individuals. Understanding this specific slur and its historical context is essential to comprehend the hateful intent of the meme.",
